@startuml
left to right direction
actor Operator
actor "Human reviewer" as Human
actor GitHub
rectangle "VS Code Ticket Enhancer plugin" {
  usecase "Poll candidate ticket" as Poll
  usecase "Draft ticket improvements" as Draft
  usecase "Assess ticket fields" as Judge
  usecase "Evaluate stop condition" as Stop
  usecase "Write lifecycle status" as Status
}
Operator --> Poll
Poll .> Draft : includes
Poll .> Judge : includes
Poll .> Stop : includes
Poll --> Status
Human --> Status : LGTM
GitHub --> Status
@enduml
